moothen skin ✿ For Dull Skin, it can brighten the skin tone ✿ Suitable for all skin types and sensitive skin ✿ Sakura extract is with excellent moisturizing and whitening effect and more than 80% of the ingredients are natural, which is safe for skin ✨Usage After facial cleansing, apply appropriate drops on the palm, evenly smear the face, neck, massage until absorption.It is recommended to use it in the morning and evening. ✨Specifications: Intensive hydration Lustrous skin tone Gentle formula, plants care ✨Package includes: 1* Sakura Serum', 29.9, 19.99, NULL, 'Beauty > Skincare > Facial Serum & Essence', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/br-11134201-820me-mqx6tyt51af8ee', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F250961519%2F7229224075', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
