 Agradecemos pela preferencia de nossos produtos Neymar jr Edutech.', 99.9, 36.9, NULL, 'Stationery > Notebooks & Papers > Notebooks & Notepads', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/br-11134207-81ztc-mj4kbzt023uqc8', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F1703420331%2F58252712744', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
