Accessories > Rain Coats', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/br-11134207-81ztc-mjpvmafwpi4h25', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F408653169%2F50401534245', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
