 12% Matéria Mineral (máx.) 70 g/kg 7% Matéria Fibrosa (máx.) 30 g/kg 3% Cálcio (máx.) 16 g/kg 1,6% Cálcio (mín) 8000 mg/kg 0,8% Fósforo (mín) 7000 mg/kg 0,7% Sódio (mín) 2000 mg/kg 0,2% Potássio (mín) 5000 mg/kg 0,5% Ômega 6 (mín) 20 g/kg 2% Ômega 3 (mín) 2200 mg/kg 0,22% Energia Metabolizável 3795 kcal/kg ________________________________________________________________________________________________ QUANTIDADE RECOMENDADA Quantidade Recomendada Peso Porção 2,0 kg 42 g 4,0 kg 70 g 6,0 kg 95 g 8,0 kg 118 g 10,0 kg 140 g 12,0 kg 161 g 14,0 kg 180 g 16,0 kg 199 g', 145.0, 73.99, NULL, 'Pets > Pet Food > Dog Food', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/br-11134207-7qukw-ljzxt23hs4967a', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F464043565%2F23896493386', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
